cherrytree-docmodel (1.6.3+docmodel6-1) plucky; urgency=low

  * eliminated internal XML round-trips in the document model, replacing them with direct object operations
  * rich table improvements: row/column copy-paste with undo, cut/paste preserving rich formatting, inherited formatting on add, in-place undo/redo
  * various rich table bug fixes: image resize, copy/cut for images and LaTeX, left border disappearing, column paste losing background color, link opening browser twice, freeze with image cells
  * fixed rich-text image sizes reverting after zoom changes
  * fixed wrong image pasted after Ctrl+C from rich cell
  * fixed cursor jumping to top of page on undo/redo

